Description: Flexible, interpretable machine learning algorithm for additive tree 
    sums ('FIGS', Tan et al., 2023, <doi:10.1073/pnas.2310151122>). Fits a sum of 
    shallow decision trees ('CART') by greedily minimizing residual impurity. 
    Includes seamless integration with 'parsnip' and 'tidymodels' workflows.
